---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<main id="top">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Disability · Ageing · Mental health</p>
      <h1>Plain English for the carer in the middle.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Posts, guides and templates that translate disability, ageing and mental health support for the people living it: the carers who are sandwiched between complex systems and the person they love. Independent, unaffiliated, occasionally funny.</p>
      <div class="find">
        <p class="eyebrow">What you'll find here</p>
        <ul class="find-list">
          {% for p in pillars %}<li><b>{{ p.name }}</b><span>{{ p.short }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#posts">See the latest posts <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/tools/">Shop the tools</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="stage-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      {% include "partials/sam-hero.njk" %}
      <div class="card-translate play" id="heroCard">
        <span class="stamp stamp-hero" aria-hidden="true">JARGON<br>REMOVED</span>
        <p class="eyebrow">What they said</p>
        <p class="hero-jargon"><span class="jargon">"Participants and nominees are encouraged to familiarise themselves with the relevant operational guidelines prior to reassessment."</span></p>
        <p class="t-label">What it means</p>
        <p class="t-meaning">Read up before your plan review. We'll show you which bits.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="tap-hint" aria-hidden="true">Tap Sam</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="posts">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Latest posts</p>
        <h2>Fresh from the feed.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="topics">
        <span class="topics-label">Browse by topic</span>
        {% for key, c in categories %}<a class="chip" href="/posts/?topic={{ key }}"><span class="dot" style="background:{{ c.color }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ c.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="post-grid">
      {% for post in collections.postsNewest | head(4) %}{% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="more">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/posts/">See all {{ collections.postsNewest | length }} posts <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      <p>Every post goes up on Facebook and Instagram first. The back catalogue keeps them all in one place, sorted by topic.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="tools">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Tools</p>
        <h2>Tools you can fill in, print and take to the meeting.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Guides, checklists, templates and scripts. Buy once, download, keep. No subscription, no account. Prices shown are placeholders until the store is live.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="guides guides-featured">
      {% for t in tools | featured %}{% include "partials/tool-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="more">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tools/">See all {{ tools | length }} tools <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      <p>One page for every tool, sorted by topic.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h2>About The Sandwich Carer</h2>
        <div class="about-body">{% renderFile "./src/_includes/content/about.md" %}</div>
      </div>
      <svg class="about-sam" viewBox="0 0 300 244" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#samCalm"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="promises">
      <div><h3>Independent.</h3><p>Written by a carer, not a provider. Nobody pays for a mention, and nobody gets to check the copy before it goes out.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Unaffiliated.</h3><p>Not the NDIA, not an aged care provider, not a mental health service. We read what they publish and tell you what it means.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Not advice.</h3><p>This is the plain-English version so you can ask better questions. It isn't legal, financial or medical advice, and it doesn't replace your planner, your provider, your doctor or your lawyer.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
